nances, and political choices affect long-term outcomes. Each in-game day takes only minutes to play, but your decisions carry forward and shape the ending you reach.</p>","developers":["VoltekPlay"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572310/3462c4e86336615a7c723f0685dd1181ae6b8c12/header.jpg?t=1772872174","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 or Ubuntu 18.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Sierra 10.12.6 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3572310/1546265750/bd5cb1e81046bb8cd3d9719d68d6a805435f68a9/1750468840/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765217028","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3572310/1546265750/bd5cb1e81046bb8cd3d9719d68d6a805435f68a9/1750468840/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765217028","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3572310/1546265750/bd5cb1e81046bb8cd3d9719d68d6a805435f68a9/1750468840/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765217028","id":257151969,"name":"Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151969/ba379c58bd552840ebdb8ae81c61361603089de2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765217028"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.ak